  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Lab 1200 BOILERS AND PRESSURE VESSELS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 157-A:3 through RSA 157-A:8\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #5371, eff 4-10-92, made extensive changes to the wording, format, structure, and numbering of rules in Chapter Lab 1200. Document #5371 supersedes all prior filings for the sections in this chapter. The prior filings for former Chapter Lab 1200 include the following documents:\n\n#1537, eff 2-20-80\n\n#2515, eff 10-25-83\n\n#4019, eff 3-21-86 EXPIRED 3-21-92",
